<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ilex Forest Ahead\nEnter through the gate.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: There you are! I get to\nAzalea first, I’m all ready to\fgloat about beating the gym before\nyou--and the whole town’s saying\fyou went down a WELL and met the\nCHAMPION?!\rI leave you alone for ONE route!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: ...You’re okay, though?\nReally?\r...Okay. Okay good. Then I want\nthe badge too, and I want the whole\fstory, in that order.\rRace you to the forest--last one\nto Goldenrod buys lunch!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Apologies. The well’s under\nprivate survey this week.\rStructural assessment. It isn’t\nsafe for the public right now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Site perimeter. The gym is open;\nthe well is not.\rMove along, please.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sixty years the well’s made the\nsame sound. Drip, and the slow\fones breathing.\rThree nights ago it started up--\nclicking. Humming. Like the inside\fof a clock.\rI don’t sleep much now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The clicking stopped. The water\nsounds like water again.\r...Mostly. Old ears keep listening\nanyway.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Did you come to get Kurt to make\nsome Poké Balls?\fA lot of people do just that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE: ...\r...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Yawn?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Azalea Town\nLiving Happily with Pokémon</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt’s House\rApricorn and Nothing Else\nThe Stubborn Poké Ball Creator</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Azalea Town Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Bugsy\fThe Walking Bug Pokémon Encyclopedia</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE Well\nAlso known as the Rainmaker Well.\rLocals believe that a SLOWPOKE’s\nyawn summons the rain.\rRecords show that a SLOWPOKE’s yawn\nended a drought 400 years ago.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charcoal Kiln\rWe let our FARFETCH’D fetch branches\nfor charcoal!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">FIELD TECH: Apologies. The well’s\nunder private survey this week.\rStructural assessment. It isn’t\nsafe for the public right now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TOWNSMAN: It’s never needed a\n“survey” in sixty years.\rThose are our SLOWPOKE down there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They’re polite, the survey\npeople. Polite as a locked door.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They packed up and vanished the\nsame hour you came up.\rSurveys don’t run from children,\ndo they?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Nine. Nine. There’s supposed\nto be fourteen by the rim this\ftime of morning.\rYou haven’t seen any wandered off\ntoward the gate, have you?\fNo. Course not.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Five gone in three days. And the\nones still here...\rLook at him. He won’t even yawn.\nA SLOWPOKE that won’t yawn isn’t\fa SLOWPOKE.\rSomething’s wrong down that well.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nine. I keep counting nine.\nI’ll keep counting till it’s\ffourteen.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Fourteen by the rim again.\nI counted twice.\rThree of them still won’t go\nnear the water. But fourteen.\fThey came home.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: You’re the one Gramps\nsent? Okay. Okay, good. I’m Turk.\rI train under Bugsy at the gym,\nI’m--that’s not important. The\fSLOWPOKE are important.\rThere are people down there. Not\ntownsfolk. They’ve got cases and\fscreens and they keep the SLOWPOKE\nin RINGS.\rNobody’ll let me past to look\nbecause I’m “just a kid.”\fI’m done being just a kid\nabout it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: I’m not asking you to fight\nmy fight for me. I’m asking you\fto fight it WITH me.\rTwo of us, side by side, the whole\nway down. You in? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: Then send yours out the\nsecond I send mine. We don’t get\fseparated.\rWhatever’s down there, we meet it\ntogether.\rThere’s a service ladder around\nthe rim--Gramps told me. The steps\fare “blocked.” The ladder isn’t.\nCome on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: ...I’ll wait. I’m not\ngoing down there alone, and I’m\fnot going home.\rSo. Whenever you’re ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: There--there they are!\nThe SLOWPOKE, are they--?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: They’re coming up, Gramps.\nThey’re hurt, some of them.\fBut they’re coming up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: ...You.\rYou’re the one Gold mentioned.\nCherrygrove. He said there was a\ftrainer worth watching.\rI should have guessed it would be\nyou down that well.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: Tell me what you saw.\nAll of it. Slowly.\r...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: May I?\r...This isn’t improvised. This is\nENGINEERED.\rWhoever did this is not a vandal.\nThey’re a professional. I’ll\ftreat them like one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: Here is what happens now.\nThe League takes this.\rWe trace the equipment, we track\nthe people, we put protection on\fthis town’s SLOWPOKE until every\nlast one is accounted for.\rYou have my word--and my word,\nthese days, moves quickly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SILVER: You did more today than\nmost trainers do in a year,\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. Rest. Earn your\nbadge. Leave the rest to me.\rAnd you. You didn’t leave them.\nRemember that the rest of your\flife.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KURT: ...Champion himself. Here,\nfast as that.\r...Well. The boy’s right. You’re\nnot just a kid anymore either, are\fyou.\rGo on. Turk’s been wanting his\nturn at you since you came up those\fsteps.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: I keep thinking about how\ncalm he was. The man at the\fterminal. “No use to anyone now.”\rI’m going to run that gym\nsomeday. And nobody’s Pokémon is\fever going to be a MEASUREMENT in\nmy town.\rCome on. Let me show you why I\nearned the right to ask you down\fthere.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s pressed flat against the\nstones, facing the wall.\rIt doesn’t yawn. It doesn’t do\nanything at all.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s back by the water’s edge--\nat a distance.\rIt watches the well and will not\ngo nearer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">FIELD TECH: Then you’ll want the\nstructure sound, won’t you.\rWe’ll be done soon.</language>
	</row>
</body>
